# Practice consultation book

Produce the CS "practice consultant" package for Nitra's top customers: one workbook row and one battle-card slide per account, each carrying spend, modelled cashback, the latest Gong conversation, anything notable online, a specific play for now, and a near-term 4P hypothesis (pillar, pain, product, POC) for pre-discovery.

Default scope is the top 100 by cumulative card spend. Confirm N, the cashback rate (default 2.2%), and whether the user wants xlsx only or xlsx plus deck before pulling data.

